SOURCELONG:Celmae Campaign Setting	SOURCESHORT:CEL	SOURCEDATE:2026-03

###Block: New Feats for Celmae Campaign

# Empalement (Combat)
# Conditions: Str 15
Empalement	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Combat	PRESTAT:1,STR=15	DESC:When you deal maximum damage with a piercing weapon, you may lodge it in the target as a combat maneuver. While impaled, the target takes 1 bleed damage per round, suffers -1 on attack and damage rolls, -2 on skill checks, and must concentrate to cast spells. You may hold the weapon (dealing normal damage as an attack action; target needs a CMB check as a standard action to remove it) or release it (standard action to remove). Removing deals normal weapon damage.	SOURCEPAGE:Celmae

# Lance et Bouclier (Combat)
# Conditions: BAB +1
Lance et Bouclier	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Combat	PREATT:1	DESC:You can wield two-handed spears (corseque, lance, pike, jousting lance) in one hand. You do not gain the 1.5x Strength bonus for two-handed weapons. If the weapon has reach, you can fight in close quarters with a -2 penalty on attack rolls.	BONUS:WIELDCATEGORY|Longspear,Spear|-1	SOURCEPAGE:Celmae

# Coup de Bouclier Opportuniste de l'Udaeus (Combat, Critical)
# Conditions: BAB +9, Critical Focus, Improved Shield Bash, Shield Proficiency
Coup de Bouclier Opportuniste de l'Udaeus	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Combat.Critical	PREATT:9	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Critical Focus	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Improved Shield Bash	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Shield Proficiency	DESC:When wielding a shield and a one-handed or light weapon, upon confirming a critical hit, you may make a shield bash against the same target as a swift action using your highest attack bonus.	SOURCEPAGE:Celmae

# Coup de Bouclier Réactif (Combat)
# Conditions: Wis 13, Improved Shield Bash, BAB +1, Shield Proficiency
Coup de Bouclier Réactif	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Combat	PRESTAT:1,WIS=13	PREATT:1	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Improved Shield Bash	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Shield Proficiency	DESC:You gain additional attacks of opportunity per round equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum +1). These can only be used for shield bash attacks. Stacks with Combat Reflexes.	SOURCEPAGE:Celmae

# Contrôle du Bouclier (Combat) — Shield Check
# Conditions: Combat Reflexes, Improved Shield Bash, Shield Proficiency, Stand Still
Contrôle du Bouclier	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Combat	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Combat Reflexes	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Improved Shield Bash	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Shield Proficiency	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Stand Still	DESC:When wielding a shield and a one-handed or light weapon, if a foe provokes an attack of opportunity by moving through a square adjacent to you, you may make a combat maneuver check as that attack of opportunity. On a success the foe cannot move for the rest of his turn and takes your shield bash damage; he may still take the rest of his action. This also applies to any creature leaving a square adjacent to you when that movement provokes an attack of opportunity.	SOURCEPAGE:Celmae

# Manoeuvre Blindée (Combat)
# Conditions: BAB +1, Str 13, Shield Proficiency
Manoeuvre Blindée	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Combat	PREATT:1	PRESTAT:1,STR=13	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Shield Proficiency	DESC:When wielding a shield and a one-handed or light weapon, you gain +2 on bull rush, disarm, overrun, and trip combat maneuver checks.	SOURCEPAGE:Celmae

# Pouvoir Rapide de Saint Thero
# Conditions: Race Udaeus, a spell-like ability usable 2/day
Pouvoir Rapide de Saint Thero	CATEGORY:FEAT	PRERACE:1,Udaeus	PREMULT:1,[PREVARGTEQ:ParangonTrueStrikeUses,2],[PREVARGTEQ:ParangonBarkskinUses,2],[PREVARGTEQ:ParangonHasteUses,2],[PREVARGTEQ:ParangonStoneskinUses,2],[PREVARGTEQ:ParangonAspectUses,2],[PREVARGTEQ:ParangonBattlemindUses,2]	DESC:Similar to Quicken Spell-Like Ability: you can use one of your spell-like abilities as a swift action 3/day. Also grants one extra daily use of an Udaeus spell-like ability normally usable 2/day. Choose which SLA gains the extra use.	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Pouvoir Rapide SLA Choice|1	SOURCEPAGE:Celmae

# Practiced Spellcaster (General)
# Prerequisites: Spellcraft 4 ranks
# Source: Complete Arcane (D&D 3.5, adapted for Pathfinder)
Practiced Spellcaster	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:General	PRESKILL:1,Spellcraft=4	DESC:You get a +4 bonus on caster level checks for %1. This bonus can't increase your caster level to beyond your Hit Dice. Does not affect spells per day or spells known.|%LIST	MULT:YES	STACK:NO	CHOOSE:NUMCHOICES=1|CLASS|SPELLCASTER	SOURCEPAGE:Complete Arcane

# Invocateur Qualifié (General) — Practiced Tactician
# Conditions: the Invocateur de Saint Thero's Invocateur Naturel or the Monster Tactician's Summon Monster, and at least 4 Hit Dice from other classes or racial Hit Dice
Invocateur Qualifié	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:General	PREVARGTEQ:CelmaeSummonClassLVL,1	PREVARGTEQ:TL-CelmaeSummonClassLVL,4	DESC:Your caster level for the class that grants your summon monster spell-like ability increases by 4, which cannot raise it beyond your Hit Dice; this increases the duration, damage, spell resistance checks and dispel checks of your spells. Your 4 Hit Dice from other classes or racial Hit Dice also add to that class's levels to determine the power of your summon monster spell-like ability (the highest summon monster available and its duration in minutes). This feat does not increase your spells per day nor the highest level of spells you can cast.	BONUS:CASTERLEVEL|Cleric|4|PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Invocateur de Saint Thero ~ Invocateur Naturel	BONUS:VAR|CelmaeSummonLVL|4	SOURCEPAGE:Celmae
